      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Bike transportation in Nagpur demands meticulous documentation to ensure a seamless, legally compliant, and secure relocation process. While the city’s robust logistics infrastructure supports high-volume two-wheeler movement, strict adherence to regulatory paperwork remains the cornerstone of risk mitigation.</p>
<p>Neglecting these administrative steps can result in significant delays, financial penalties, or denial of liability claims during transit. To safeguard your investment and expedite the delivery timeline, it is imperative to prepare a comprehensive dossier that satisfies both Indian legal standards and specific carrier requirements.</p>

<h3>Core Documentation Checklist</h3>
<p>The foundation of any bike transit shipment rests on four critical documents. Each item serves a distinct legal and operational purpose, validating ownership, roadworthiness, and contractual agreement between the shipper and the logistics provider.</p>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Self-Attested RC Photocopy:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Registration Certificate (RC) is the primary proof of vehicle ownership. For inter-state or long-distance transport within Maharashtra, a self-attested photocopy is typically required. This document verifies that the vehicle is legally registered and matches the chassis and engine numbers recorded by the transport agency, preventing any disputes regarding asset identity during loading or unloading.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Current PUC Certificate:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Pollution Under Control (PUC) certificate confirms that the vehicle meets environmental emission standards. While the bike is not being driven on public roads during transit, transport agencies often require a valid PUC to ensure the vehicle is in a mechanically sound and legally operable state.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
  <li style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
    <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
    <span>An expired PUC may flag the vehicle as non-compliant, potentially halting the booking process</span>
  </li>
</ul>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Valid Insurance Certificate:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">A current comprehensive insurance policy is mandatory. This document proves that the vehicle is covered against third-party liability and accidental damage. Logistics partners verify this to confirm that the asset is protected against unforeseen incidents, ensuring that any pre-existing coverage remains intact during the transit period.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA-Approved Consignment Bilty:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The consignment bilty acts as the contract of carriage. It must be approved by the Indian Banks' Association (IBA) to serve as a valid financial and legal instrument. This document details the origin, destination, weight, and declared value of the shipment.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
  <li style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
    <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
    <span>Without an IBA-compliant bilty, the transport company cannot legally claim responsibility for the cargo, leaving the owner exposed in the event of loss or damage</span>
  </li>
</ul>
  </div>
</div>

<h3>Maximizing Protection with Marine Transit Insurance</h3>
<p>Beyond standard documentation, securing <strong>100% declared-value marine transit insurance</strong> is a critical strategic move for high-value motorcycles. Standard transport coverage often has capped liability limits, which may fall short of the actual market value of premium bikes.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">By opting for marine transit insurance at the full declared value, the owner ensures that any damage, theft, or total loss during transit is compensated at the bike’s current market rate.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This layer of financial protection eliminates the risk of out-of-pocket repairs and provides peace of mind, ensuring that the logistics journey is as secure as the documentation supporting it.</span></li></ul></div>
